<title>JAPAN: Forval to issue 6 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Forval to issue 6 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Forval Corp</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Sumitomo Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   1	  AMT   6 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 30.Sep.03</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 2.Dec.96   CONV TO 29.Sep.03</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 24.Oct.96  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 9.Oct-16.Oct</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI  BBB-     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on October 8.</p>
</text>
